Abstraction is used to hide internal functionality of code using
abstract class and interface in java which also support Multiple inheritance.

abstract class :In java to create abstract class we use abstract keyword and each
abstract class have atleast one abstract method.

In this we hide internal functionality of class and define it's implementation in another class
70 to 80%

interface :In java interface keyword is used to hide internal functionality which also support
multiple inheritance.It is a  mechanism which 100% data will get abstract.

class ->inherit->extends
interface->inherit->implements






